<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>久泻 - 标签 | 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E4%B9%85%E6%B3%BB/</link><description>这里不仅是我研习中医经典的私人书斋，更是一处致力于 “观照经典以明医理，颐养身心以扶正气” 的清净之地。</description><generator>Hugo 0.161.0 &amp; FixIt v1.0.0-alpha-mt895zhg</generator><language>zh-CN</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</webMaster><copyright>本站内容采用 CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 国际许可协议。</copyright><lastBuildDate>Thu, 04 Jun 2026 14:49:52 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E4%B9%85%E6%B3%BB/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>收治法：论久嗽 久泻 久汗</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/4-14-shouzhifa/</link><pubDate>Thu, 04 Jun 2026 14:46:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/4-14-shouzhifa/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E5%9B%9B%E5%BE%A1%E9%9B%86/">卷四御集</category><description>本节为《石室秘录》“收治法”部分，专论&lt;strong&gt;久嗽、久泻、久汗&lt;/strong&gt;三症因“气散不固”所致的收敛法则。核心思想是：&lt;strong&gt;气散而收之，先以收敛固脱治标，再以补肾益气固本&lt;/strong&gt;。不可一味发散或纯用涩止，当补涩兼施、标本兼顾。</description></item></channel></rss>